Stage locally-built .debs here. The customize-image.sh hook installs
every *.deb in this directory into the assembled rootfs via apt.

Expected files after running `dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b` in
../move-bringup/:

    ablspi-dkms_1.0.0-1_all.deb
    move-bringup_1.0.0-1_arm64.deb

Also stage the kernel-config fragment under userpatches/ so the
move-kernel-config extension can find it:

    cp ../../kernel-config/move.fragment.config userpatches/

And stage the DTS sources so customize-image.sh can compile them:

    cp ../../dts/ablspi-move-cm*.dts userpatches/extras/dts/
